// LightmappedGeneric and WorldVertexTransition (lightmappedgeneric_ps20b /
// lightmappedgeneric_vs20) with the static combos the native lightmapped
// family does not draw, which take the legacy port: WARPLIGHTING (the light
// warp lookup of the lightmap's length, with bumped and ssbumped lightmaps,
// self-illumination and env maps), FANCY_BLENDING (the blend modulation's
// smoothstep of the vertex alpha, masked blending and the blend mask
// transform, blended bump maps and their alpha, disabled under height fog and
// with self-illumination), SEAMLESS (three planar projections weighted by the
// squared normal, with a second base texture, a bump map and an envmap mask)
// and the distance-coded alpha's OUTLINE and SOFTEDGES. Bumped cases step uv1
// through the three bumped pages by uv2; env map cases use brush tangents.
// The other combos are in forced/lightmappedgeneric_native_combos.vdf. In
// integer HDR LoadCubeMap loads the cube map's ".hdr" name.
